OL,3,GNEWSATinie Tempah 'going big' for
OL,4,AScunthorpe visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FTinie Tempah says he would be
OL,7,Finterested in mentoring the next
OL,8,Fgeneration of music artists in
OL,9,FScunthorpe as part of his upcoming
OL,10,Fvisit.
OL,12,FThe rapper confirmed he will perform in
OL,13,Fthe town after an online campaign was
OL,14,Fstarted by a local fan - 16 years after
OL,15,Fhis single Pass Out was released, which
OL,16,Fincludes a reference to Scunthorpe.
OL,18,FTempah said he would like to make his
OL,19,Fvisit a "full day affair," which he
OL,20,Fthinks will happen "at some point
OL,21,Fduring the summer, or just before
OL,22,Fsummer" next year.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
